<title>INDIA: Krung Thai Bank sets Indian prime rate.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank sets Indian prime rate.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Krung Thai Bank Pcl set its Indian prime lending rate at 17.25 percent per annum, an official of its Bombay branch said on Monday.</p>
<p>It did not have a prime rate earlier. The Bombay branch is Krung Thai's first in India. It began operations on January 31.</p>
<p>The spread above the prime rate would be 4.5 percent, the official said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
